{"4771500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Zone: Quarantine", "steam_appid": 4771500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5017160], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LAST ZONE IS A BRUTAL CO-OP SURVIVAL GAME SET IN A POST-SOVIET WORLD.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen into chaos, and every step is a fight for survival. Face hordes of mutants, ruthless factions, and a constant shortage of resources. Team up with friends, turn ruins into an impregnable fortress, craft equipment, and fight back against the wasteland itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: survive, secure your place, and uncover what turned this world into hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op in LAST ZONE is all about teamwork: while one player searches for supplies, another builds defenses, and a third fights off mutants. Only by working together can you transform ruins into a stronghold capable of resisting the horrors of the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/cf3c85bc7c3271b80cfe88d690a48bf7.poster.avif?t=1788166645\" width=720 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/cf3c85bc7c3271b80cfe88d690a48bf7.webm?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/cf3c85bc7c3271b80cfe88d690a48bf7.mp4?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFECTED ZONES ARE THE RICHEST — AND THE DEADLIEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infected zones are the richest — and the deadliest — places in the world. Face hordes of mutants with unique behaviors and abilities. Use tactics, monitor radiation levels, and always watch your corners: only those who stay alert survive here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/e7d2901a441ce027c6a135b98892a22d.poster.avif?t=1788166645\" width=720 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/e7d2901a441ce027c6a135b98892a22d.webm?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/e7d2901a441ce027c6a135b98892a22d.mp4?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE COUNTRYSIDE IS THE PERFECT PLACE TO HIDE. OR DIE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the haunting atmosphere of abandoned villages. Supplies are scarcer here than in the cities, and so are your chances of surviving alone. Fortify an old country house, fend off mutants in the fields, and use the terrain to protect your shelter. You are in charge here — until night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/4107316e5e7275dbef3175633cff283c.poster.avif?t=1788166645\" width=720 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/4107316e5e7275dbef3175633cff283c.webm?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/4107316e5e7275dbef3175633cff283c.mp4?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILDING IS YOUR KEY TO SURVIVAL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, construct walls and defensive structures, and turn abandoned buildings into fortified bastions capable of withstanding mutant raids and unwanted visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/5b6167c16ee85d8f540578e17e76fcf9.poster.avif?t=1788166645\" width=720 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/5b6167c16ee85d8f540578e17e76fcf9.webm?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/5b6167c16ee85d8f540578e17e76fcf9.mp4?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PANEL APARTMENT BLOCKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These grim concrete labyrinths hide either valuable loot or certain death behind every apartment door. Search every floor, move carefully through the stairwells, and try not to get trapped inside these endless concrete boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/fb0da31ddaab50583e9f4c96431dfd58.poster.avif?t=1788166645\" width=720 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/fb0da31ddaab50583e9f4c96431dfd58.webm?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/fb0da31ddaab50583e9f4c96431dfd58.mp4?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RIVERS AND LAKES ARE MORE THAN JUST SCENERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are also a source of food. Grab a fishing rod, find a quiet spot, and catch fish before the local creatures notice you. A peaceful fishing trip may be your only chance to rest and fill your stomach after another harsh day in the Zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/1cea03b03949dbe5b09ef969490e49f1.poster.avif?t=1788166645\" width=720 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/1cea03b03949dbe5b09ef969490e49f1.webm?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/1cea03b03949dbe5b09ef969490e49f1.mp4?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DO NOT LOOK FOR EASY PATHS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best loot is hidden behind boarded-up windows and locked doors. Break your way inside to find truly valuable gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/46fee297bd28408e65a15bd0b22bb638.poster.avif?t=1788166645\" width=720 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/46fee297bd28408e65a15bd0b22bb638.webm?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771500/extras/46fee297bd28408e65a15bd0b22bb638.mp4?t=1788166645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LAST ZONE IS A BRUTAL CO-OP SURVIVAL GAME SET IN A POST-SOVIET WORLD.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen into chaos, and every step is a fight for survival. Face hordes of mutants, ruthless factions, and a constant shortage of resources. Team up with friends, turn ruins into an impregnable fortress, craft equipment, and fight back against the wasteland itself.</p><p class=\